  "confidence": "moderate",
  "decision_summary": "All retrieved experimental analogues have absolute oral bioavailability values above 20%, with the closest analogue piritrexim ranging from 23% to 75%; no affirmative evidence supports F < 20%, so the query is predicted to have high oral bioavailability at the F >= 20% threshold.",
